WEBVTT

00:02:24.396 --> 00:02:30.676
we, for example, ignore effects
that contradict our convictions.

00:02:30.676 --> 00:02:34.356
So correcting fake news
is definitely necessary,

00:02:34.396 --> 00:02:38.236
but it's not sufficient
to get a divided society

00:02:38.276 --> 00:02:39.756
to rethink itself.

00:02:40.716 --> 00:02:43.996
Fortunately, according to
at least some research,

00:02:44.036 --> 00:02:47.756
there may be a simple way
to get a new perspective:

00:02:47.796 --> 00:02:50.876
a personal one-on-one discussion

00:02:50.916 --> 00:02:53.996
with someone who doesn't
have your opinion.

00:02:54.876 --> 00:02:58.356
It enables you to see
the world in a new way,

00:02:58.356 --> 00:03:01.356
through someone else's eyes.